{"id":"6fb25d603f77631d","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-pr-functions.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function Examples","display":"ex-pr-functions — Primitive Recursive Function Examples","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-pr-functions","aliases":["92-ex-pr-functions"],"display":"ex-pr-functions — Primitive Recursive Function Examples","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-df-zero-function]]","[[92-df-successor-function]]","[[92-df-projection-function]]"],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-pr-functions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-pr-functions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-pr-functions — Primitive Recursive Function Examples"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,S,P_1^1\">\\(Z,S,P_1^1\\)</span> (basic primitive-recursive functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a599a2f4a391801b\" href=\"?note=a599a2f4a391801b\" title=\"92-df-projection-function\">92-df-projection-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mult},\\mathrm{exp},\\mathrm{fact},\\mathrm{pred}\">\\(\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mult},\\mathrm{exp},\\mathrm{fact},\\mathrm{pred}\\)</span> (example function symbols)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}pr\\text{-}functions}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(Z(n)=0\\land S(n)=n+1\\land P_1^1(n)=n\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{add}(x,y)=x+y\\land\\mathrm{mult}(x,y)=x\\cdot y\\land\n\\mathrm{exp}(x,y)=x^y\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{fact}(0)=1\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{fact}(n+1)=(n+1)\\mathrm{fact}(n),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{pred}(0)=0\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{pred}(n+1)=n,\\\\\n&amp;\\{Z,S,P_1^1,\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mult},\\mathrm{exp},\\mathrm{fact},\\mathrm{pred}\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}pr\\text{-}functions}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(Z(n)=0\\land S(n)=n+1\\land P_1^1(n)=n\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{add}(x,y)=x+y\\land\\mathrm{mult}(x,y)=x\\cdot y\\land\n\\mathrm{exp}(x,y)=x^y\\bigr),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{fact}(0)=1\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{fact}(n+1)=(n+1)\\mathrm{fact}(n),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{pred}(0)=0\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{pred}(n+1)=n,\\\\\n&amp;\\{Z,S,P_1^1,\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mult},\\mathrm{exp},\\mathrm{fact},\\mathrm{pred}\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有这些函数都是原始递归的</li>\n<li>加法、乘法、指数由PR运算构造</li>\n<li>阶乘：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0! = 1\">\\(0! = 1\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+1)! = n! \\cdot (n+1)\">\\((n+1)! = n! \\cdot (n+1)\\)</span></li>\n<li>前驱：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pred}(0) = 0\">\\(\\mathrm{pred}(0) = 0\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pred}(n+1) = n\">\\(\\mathrm{pred}(n+1) = n\\)</span></li>\n<li>这些函数在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>中都可表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z,S,P_1^1$ (basic primitive-recursive functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]], [[92-df-successor-function]], [[92-df-projection-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z,S,P_1^1$ (basic primitive-recursive functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]], [[92-df-successor-function]], [[92-df-projection-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"a599a2f4a391801b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z,S,P_1^1$ (basic primitive-recursive functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]], [[92-df-successor-function]], [[92-df-projection-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"Z,S,P_1^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mult},\\mathrm{exp},\\mathrm{fact},\\mathrm{pred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}pr\\text{-}functions}\\vdash{}&\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(Z(n)=0\\land S(n)=n+1\\land P_1^1(n)=n\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{add}(x,y)=x+y\\land\\mathrm{mult}(x,y)=x\\cdot y\\land\n\\mathrm{exp}(x,y)=x^y\\bigr),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{fact}(0)=1\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{fact}(n+1)=(n+1)\\mathrm{fact}(n),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{pred}(0)=0\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{pred}(n+1)=n,\\\\\n&\\{Z,S,P_1^1,\\mathrm{add},\\mathrm{mult},\\mathrm{exp},\\mathrm{fact},\\mathrm{pred}\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathrm{PR}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0! = 1","display":false},{"tex":"(n+1)! = n! \\cdot (n+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pred}(0) = 0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pred}(n+1) = n","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1817,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-385","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-ex-pr-functions]]"}],"outgoing":["8bff810dd710385a","69750ae210519a25","fadfd5a594e57bef","a599a2f4a391801b"]}